{"t": 1794114080.4961088, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout/promo.py` (`checkout.promo.normalize_code`).\n\nProduction error: Sentry `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` \u2014 `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` (2,940 events, Android 15 / app 8.2).\n\n`normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes all inner whitespace, and upper-cases the code before lookup:\n\n```python\nreturn \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nVerified against the failing input and variants (`' autumn24 '`, `'autumn 24'`, `'  Autumn  24  '` \u2192 `AUTUMN24`).", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
